    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if i can get to the doctor right this second, it's like 10pm and we're pretty far from the clinic. do you think it's worth sitting on this until the morning? he seems okay otherwise just a bit lethargic and warm. it just looks like a normal childhood rash to me, maybe a virus?",
