    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "so i checked again and the spots are still there and he's a little bit sleepy but he's still playing with his toys and eating snacks. i really dont want to go to the ER if it's just a virus, it's so expensive and exhausting. do you think i could just give him some child ibuprofen to bring the fever down and see if the rash fades by morning? surely if he's eating and playing it's not an emergency right?",
